.TH XAMLTECH-NMAP 1 "2026-01-01" "xamltech-nmap-toolkit" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xamltech-nmap \- authorized network discovery and diagnostics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xamltech-nmap
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generated from lib/options.sh by `make docs`. Do not edit by hand.
